# Code++ — Licenses of Bundled Rust Crates

Code++ and its bundled plugins are built from the Rust crates listed below, Code++'s own among them, each under the license shown. This file is generated by `cargo about` from the lockfile of the release it ships with. It covers the whole workspace and every platform Code++ is released for, so a crate listed here may not be part of the build for your platform.

Code++'s own license is in `LICENSE`. The notices of the components that are not Rust crates (Scintilla, Lexilla, the system toolkits) are in `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`.

